certmgr (0.9.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Per-user setting to show times in UTC or the browser's time zone.
  * Security fixes: password-change attempts are rate-limited, SMTP ports
    and error messages are restricted, unencrypted exports need confirmation,
    and CRL numbers are unique per CA.
  * Faster pages and alert checks with fewer queries; public-key
    fingerprints are stored and filled in on upgrade.
  * No longer takes over install.sh installations or reads
    /etc/certmgr/notify.conf.

 -- tvjay <11197859+tvjay@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:30:00 -0400

